proxy-for-self

Rust gateway and Vue admin derived from zyycn/codex-proxy-rs,
baseline 60e0d4ee92266d7a3bb9ffe83e60c4963c8f6cbf, Apache-2.0 (LICENSE).
Contains modified account/key routing, encrypted credential storage, Native
continuation, Excel worker integration, UI and lifecycle handling.

plugins/excel-bridge derives from Kaixxrua/excel-codex-bridge,
baseline 168ed925548d6149a9dde15651b40211a926a3c9, Unlicense.
Only the private worker and its protocol/image/model dependencies are retained.
Desktop launchers, login capture, SUB2API service and updater are omitted.
The retained adapters have been modified for gateway-bound credentials.
License texts: licenses/ and plugins/excel-bridge/LICENSE.

Dependency versions remain pinned in Cargo.lock and frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml;
third-party dependency licenses remain applicable.
Original internal crate/module names are retained for compatibility.
